1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,795
Ruko! Helmet kahan hai?

2
00:00:02,095 --> 00:00:03,080
Sir, ghar pe hai.

3
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:04,251
Ghar pe kyun?

4
00:00:04,551 --> 00:00:07,613
Sir, sar mein dard tha, to use aaram karne chhod aaya.

5
00:00:07,913 --> 00:00:11,459
Achha? To challan bhi aaram se katega. 1000 rupaye!
